Register the recovered mid-function span-setup entry FUN_00411e0c

The prim-setup table @0x460060.. holds one entry (slot 0x4601ac) pointing INSIDE
FUN_00411c78 (Watcom shared-tail entry @0x411e0c). Ghidra had no function there ->
unrelocated raw address -> execute-fault 0x411e0c (L3/L5 post-420 frontier).
Created via CreateMissingFns (951 fns exported), this patch maps it for relocation.

--- a/dd2_dispatch.c
+++ b/dd2_dispatch.c
@@ -490,6 +490,7 @@
 extern int Load_Game_Vags();
 extern int Clear_SoundFx();
 extern int FUN_00448368();
+extern int FUN_00411e0c();
 extern int FUN_0041eeec();
 extern int FUN_0041fa30();
 extern int FUN_00448e50();
@@ -1358,6 +1359,7 @@
 {0x00448310,(void*)&Load_Game_Vags},
 {0x00448364,(void*)&Clear_SoundFx},
 {0x00448368,(void*)&FUN_00448368},
+{0x00411e0c,(void*)&FUN_00411e0c},
 {0x0041eeec,(void*)&FUN_0041eeec},
 {0x0041fa30,(void*)&FUN_0041fa30},
 {0x00448e50,(void*)&FUN_00448e50},
